(35) Decryption : reverse of encryption;

(36) Denial of service : attack by saturation of a resource of the informa tion system or 
electronic communication network to make it collaps e and unable to provide expected 
services;

(37) Distributed Denial of Service : simultaneous attack of the resources of an inform ation 
system or electronic communication network in order to saturate and amplify the effects of 
